  "id": "section-980",
  "title": "造反派要听周总理的话",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-360.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>360)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　造反派不听周总理的话，还叫什么造反派？矛头对准周总理，就是对准我、林彪。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-359.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-361.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
